//! sequence playback with the live fused pipeline behind it.
//!
//! Node parameters are edited in a properties bin (right panel) keyed off the
//! snarl selection. Read nodes each own a reader slot and point
//! at a sequence directory; loading one rebuilds the playback rig (staging
//! ring sized to the largest plate, player over every loaded Read).

